I have been searching for curses based multi-user games which run under
sVr4, and recently found 'mdg'. With a slight change to the makefile
(replacing -ltinfo with -lcurses) the main game runs fine, but I have
major problems with the mdg_char program.

	the mdg_char program starts up fine, and displays the user's
statistics, and the change alignment, buy life, and change name functions
work, but the program dumps core (but saves name and alignment changes!?)
when:

	I choose to study a spell, pick the spell, and confirm that I want
to study it.

	when I choose quit, and choose to save changes.

I've used truss, ctrace, and anything else I could think of, but i cannot
figure out WHY it fails. the error as shown by truss is:


